on damage:
    attacker is not victim
    if attacker's tool is a mace:
        if attacker's tool's lore contains "&r&bLightweight":
            set gliding of attacker to false
            if fall distance of attacker < 2:
                set fall distance of attacker to 2
            set damage to damage * 0.5
            apply speed to attacker for 5 seconds
            if attacker's tool is enchanted with wind burst:
                wait 1 tick
                set {_v} to velocity of attacker
                set velocity of attacker to vector(x component of {_v} * 2, y component of {_v} * 1.5, z component of {_v} * 2)

on damage:
    if damage cause is fall:
        if victim's tool's lore contains "&r&bLightweight":
            set damage to damage * 0.5